---
// Problem vs Solution — surface-container background shift (no divider lines)
// Why: makes the visitor feel understood before showing the product
---

<section class="ps section-pad">
  <div class="container">

    <div class="ps__grid">
      <!-- PROBLEM -->
      <div class="ps__panel ps__panel--problem reveal">
        <div class="chip chip-tertiary ps__chip">El problema</div>
        <h2 class="display-sm ps__title">
          Perder clientes no es accidente.<br />Es desorganización.
        </h2>
        <ul class="ps__list">
          {[
            'Nombres en libretas, historial en WhatsApp, tallas en Excel.',
            'No recuerdas cuándo fue su última visita ni qué compró.',
            'Te pierdes cumpleaños, gustos, oportunidades de venta.',
            'Tienes datos pero no inteligencia para actuar.',
          ].map((item) => (
            <li class="ps__item ps__item--problem">
              <div class="ps__icon ps__icon--x" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none">
                  <path d="M3 3l8 8M11 3L3 11"
                        stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"/>
                </svg>
              </div>
              <span>{item}</span>
            </li>
          ))}
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- DIVIDER visual — green arrow, not a line -->
      <div class="ps__arrow" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="ps__arrow-circle">
          <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none">
            <path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"
                  stroke="white" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- SOLUTION -->
      <div class="ps__panel ps__panel--solution reveal" style="--delay:0.12s">
        <div class="chip ps__chip">La solución</div>
        <h2 class="display-sm ps__title">
          Una vista 360° de cada cliente.<br />Siempre disponible.
        </h2>
        <ul class="ps__list">
          {[
            'Perfil completo: nombre, tallas, preferencias, historial de compras.',
            'Sabes exactamente cuándo contactar y qué ofrecerle.',
            'Alertas automáticas para hacer seguimiento en el momento correcto.',
            'Datos que se convierten en ventas reales.',
          ].map((item) => (
            <li class="ps__item ps__item--solution">
              <div class="ps__icon ps__icon--check" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none">
                  <path d="M2.5 7l4 4L11.5 4"
                        stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
                </svg>
              </div>
              <span>{item}</span>
            </li>
          ))}
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .ps {
    background: var(--surface-container);
  }

  .ps__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr auto 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-8);
    align-items: center;
  }

  .ps__chip { margin-bottom: var(--space-5); }

  .ps__panel {
    background: var(--surface-lowest);
    border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
    padding: var(--space-10) var(--space-8);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-ambient-sm);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0;
    height: 100%;
  }

  .ps__panel--problem { }

  .ps__panel--solution {
    background: var(--primary-fixed);
  }

  .ps__title {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-6);
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }

  .ps__list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-4);
  }

  .ps__item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: var(--space-3);
    font-size: var(--text-body-md);
    color: var(--on-surface-variant);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .ps__icon {
    width: 22px;
    height: 22px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    margin-top: 1px;
  }

  .ps__icon--x {
    background: var(--tertiary-container);
    color: var(--tertiary);
  }

  .ps__icon--check {
    background: var(--primary);
    color: var(--on-primary);
  }

  /* Arrow divider */
  .ps__arrow {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .ps__arrow-circle {
    width: 52px;
    height: 52px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--gradient-primary);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-ambient-md);
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .ps__grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .ps__arrow {
      transform: rotate(90deg);
    }
  }
</style>
